\fs36 Controls (Default)\b0\fs24\par
\i\fs20 WASD (and arrow keys)\tab - Movement\par
JKLOUIM\tab -\tab - Action\par
P\tab\tab -\tab - Open/Close Pause Menu\i0\fs24\par
\par
\ul Movement\ulnone\par
A:\tab -\tab Move Left\par
D:\tab -\tab Move Right\par
J:\tab -\tab Jump\par
Up + J:\tab\tab Dash Forward\par
Down + J\tab Dash Backward\par
\par
\ul Attacks\ulnone\par
\i While on the ground\i0\par
K:\tab -\tab -\tab Horizontal Strike\par
S + K:\tab -\tab -\tab Vertical Strike\par
W + K:\tab -\tab -\tab Upward Strike\par
Forward + K:\tab -\tab Stab\par
The 3rd attack in a combo string has 50% more power.\par
\par
\i While in the air\i0\par
S + K (while falling):\tab Downward Strike\par
\par
\ul Skills\ulnone\par
L:\tab Use Technique\par
O:\tab Use Spell - from current element\par
U:\tab Cycle back through elements\par
I:\tab Cycle forward through elements\par
M:\tab Engage Rave Mode\par
\par
\ul Pause Menu\ulnone\par
WASD: \tab Cursor Movement\par
J:\tab -\tab Confirm\par
UI:\tab -\tab Cycle submenus\par
1-8\tab -\tab Goto submenu\par
1=STATUS\par
2=INVENTORY\par
3=TECHNIQUES\par
4=SKILLS\par
5=OPTIONS\par
6=QUEST\par
7=RECORDS\par
8=CONTROLS\par
\par
F3:\tab Toggles 1x/2x windowed mode\par
F4:\tab Toggles full screen/windowed mode\par
F9:\tab Take a screenshot\par
Esc:\tab Close the game\par
